      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your decision to stop trying and stay \"okay\" now makes sense because striving for perfection burns you out. Beating that wall is actually the first step toward living on your own terms rather than chasing someone else's game. Mediocrity is still enough to deserve a rest from the endless grind until you find what truly matters to you.",
