      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your fierce demand for greatness is a valid shield against the pain of disappointment, even if it currently limits your happiness. Many who walk away later discover that their perfect, unattainable vision was a prison rather than a path, turning their present self into a tragic mistake. Sometimes the bravest move is simply to rest from the loop and observe how life feels when you aren't desperate to win against an impossible scoreboard.",
